## Assumptions and limitations

RNA is not flux, stores, localization, uptake, efflux, protein abundance or processing. Native rat-reference Pmp22 counts are not asserted to fully recover the engineered transgene; no total-dose claim follows from a P18 reference-gene decrease. Acly is pleiotropic (acetyl-CoA/histone acetylation, fatty-acid substrate supply and differentiation), not an instrument isolating cholesterol. Five-week RNA, six-week lipidomics and twelve-week histone assays in the source are separate cohorts/ages, not paired temporal mediation. Bulk-cell fractions, sex/litter identities and donor independence remain incompletely documented; conditional library-level uncertainty does not resolve them.

